e + N -> N^2+ + 3e, HMS 2017 x 1.3 SENSITIVITY branch (abep-n2n-0.11; HMS Sec. 3.19: double-ionization cross sections accurate to ~30 %). Hahn, Muller & Savin, ApJ 850, 122 (2017), VizieR J/ApJ/850/122 table2 (Z=7, qi=0, qf=2): Eq. (2) direct DI (Eth 44.1354 eV, p0 43, f 1) + Eq. (3) K-shell IA (Eth 403 eV, fBR 0.9926, p0 3.6, p1 5). Semi-empirical; NO experimental neutral-N data in their Table 1 (N-like scheme from ions). Built by scripts/build_multiply_charged_tables.py.
